          {
            "number": 217,
            "url": "https://github.com/Huber-group-EMBL/rhdf5/pull/217",
            "title": "add h5getAllChunkInfo",
            "body": "Add function h5getAllChunkInfo()`  to iterate and return all chunk information. Wish of #210 \r\n\r\ndraft NEWS: \r\n\r\n```\r\n## New function\r\n\r\n- `h5getAllChunkInfo()` iterates over all stored chunks of a chunked HDF5 dataset,\r\n  returning a list with elements `offset` (logical chunk origins as an integer\r\n  matrix), `filter_mask`, `addr` (file byte offsets), and `size` (compressed\r\n  chunk sizes). Requires chunked storage; contiguous datasets raise an error.\r\n  (#217)\r\n```",
            "mergedAt": "2026-07-29T20:36:09Z",
